  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to use the services provided by Smash Cash Rush. Smash Cash Rush
    respects your privacy and personal information protection very much. This Privacy
    Policy applies to your access and use of the various services provided by Smash
    Cash Rush through any means.\n1. How to collect personal information\n   We only
    collect information necessary to achieve product functionality based on the principles
    of legality, legitimacy, and necessity. For example, the information you voluntarily
    provide when choosing to participate in various activities related to the application.
    The information we request is stored on your device and will not be collected
    by us or any third party. In addition, we do not collect any facial data and
    do not store facial data.\n2. How to use personal information\n   This application
    will not provide, sell, rent, share, or trade your personal information to any
    unrelated third party unless you have given prior permission, or the third party
    and this application (including its affiliated companies) provide services to
    you separately or jointly, and after the service ends, they will be prohibited
    from accessing all materials, including those they were previously able to access.\n  
    When using your personal information for purposes not specified in this policy,
    or when using information collected for specific purposes for other purposes,
    we will seek your consent in advance.\n   For the personal information you provide
    when using the product or service, unless you delete it or refuse our collection
    through relevant settings, you will continue to authorize its use during the
    use of the product or service. When you cancel your account, we will stop and
    delete your personal information.\n3. Information storage\n   Unless required
    by law to delete your personal information or we accept your request to delete
    information, we will retain your personal information for the purpose of providing
    services to you. In order to ensure that your personal information is protected
    in accordance with the law, we will store your information in accordance with
    relevant national laws and regulations on privacy data protection. When we no
    longer need to use your personal data or retain it to comply with our legal or
    regulatory obligations, we will delete the data as required to comply with relevant
    laws and regulations.\n4. Information protection\n   To help ensure a secure
    player experience, we are continuously developing and implementing administrative,
    technical, and physical security measures to protect your data from unauthorized
    access or loss, misuse, or alteration.\n5. Information Disclosure\n   We may
    disclose your information within the scope permitted by law, such as to comply
    with subpoenas or when we believe that the disclosure of information complies
    with legal requirements; investigating fraudulent behavior, responding to government
    requests, enforcing or applying our rights; or to protect the rights, property,
    or safety of us, our users, or others. This includes exchanging information with
    other companies and organizations to prevent fraud.\n6. Internet environment
    security\n   Please understand that due to technical restrictions and possible
    malicious means, in the Internet industry, even if we try our best to strengthen
    security measures, it is impossible to always ensure 100% security of information.
    You need to understand that the system and communication network used by the
    service you are accessing may experience issues due to uncontrollable factors.\n7.
    Our Policy Regarding Children\n   We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal
    data from anyone under the age of 16, nor do we knowingly allow such persons
    to use our Services. If you are under 16, please do not send any information
    about yourself to us, including your name, address, telephone number, or email
    address. Individuals under the age of 16 are prohibited from providing any personal
    data. In the event that we learn we have collected personal data from a child
    under the age of 16, we will promptly delete that information. If you believe
    we may have any information from or about a child under the age of 16, please
    contact us.\nContact Smash Cash Rush\nproductionsheadway@gmail.com"
